			"notes": "**What's new?**\n- **Fixed play time calculation** — the world indicator now shows **your own** play time (read from your player stats file) instead of the sum of all players who ever played the world, so it matches the in-game Statistics screen ([#2](https://github.com/korovagg/WorldPlayTimeReborn/issues/2)).\n- If your account has no stats file in a world, the play time of all players is shown as a fallback, so the indicator doesn't disappear.\n- **New option: \"Count Play Time Of All Players\"** — restores the old world-total behavior if you prefer it.\n- **New: world save size** — the save-directory size is now displayed beneath the play time in the world selection screen, with a new **\"Show World Size\"** option (enabled by default) (feature from PR #1 by [@deanxbox](https://github.com/deanxbox)).\n- Fixed the missing mod icon in the 1.21.11 and 26.1.2 NeoForge builds."
		},
